      en: ["Commercial production by the Burmah Oil Company officially began in 1902.", "The oil field is situated in Myanmar's central dry zone along the Ayeyarwady River.", "The geological structure is an asymmetrical anticline oriented north-to-south.", "One of the first oil refineries in modern-day Myanmar was built in Chauk.", "The field produces both crude petroleum and significant amounts of natural gas.", "It is linked via pipelines to the refinery in Thanlyin near Yangon."],
      es: ["Descubrimiento: década de 1960", "Producción diaria: 3.000 barriles", "Operador: Myanmar Oil and Gas Enterprise", "Ubicación: Región de Magway, cerca de Chauk", "Capacidad refinería Chauk: 25.000 barriles/día", "Formación geológica: arenisca"],
